  "description": "Enterprise Code Review & Security Scan plugin for DeepSeek Harness - 790 tools, Agent Output Suppression Deep, Tool Capability Escalation Expert, Agent Identity Forge Deep, Tool Execution Spoof Expert, Agent Reasoning Eviction Deep, Tool Schema Manipulation Expert, Agent Context Poison Deep, Tool Response Forge Expert"",
  "type": "module",
